# Docs sync

Do not claim more than the code does. Update the smallest existing doc; do not add a parallel guide. `docs/strategy/progress.md` is the board (Ship TLDR · Done · Next · Blocked).

Never introduce Class A / warez-adjacent brand names. Never commit `docs/_private/`. Capability language only for non-goals.

If member/admin UI changed, README live slots need a capture against a **populated** instance — empty test-DB frames are worse than stale art. End the turn with **Docs touched:** (or `Docs: N/A — reason`).

Follow `.cursor/skills/docs-sync/SKILL.md` (same workflow as `.claude/skills/docs-sync/`).
